v 3
d svyslim -- design-preserving subpopulation reduction for complex survey data
d
d Reduce a complex survey dataset to an analytic subpopulation while
d preserving design-based point and variance estimation, so that
d svy, subpop() on the small file reproduces the full-data result.
d
d Author: David Aduragbemi Okunlola
d Support: okunloladavid4@gmail.com
d
p svyslim  reduce complex survey data to a subpopulation, preserving design-based inference
